{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Wynne waves back.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:29:32.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745544969418309672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web approaches. \"This is a dream.\" They say. \"Any place or scenery Wynne want?\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:30:13.997000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745545144454873178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They nod. “Nowhere you’ve been, unfortunately. I miss home.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:31:04.147000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745545354799480853","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Think about what it looks like. Imagine home.\" Web gestures and an area to the right of them begins to waver, as if it is not real. \"Can let you give ideas.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:32:38.291000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745545749668036688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
