{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"The wavering spot begins to change, becoming whatever focal point Wynne draws on first. The ripple begins to spread over the entire scene until Web and Wynne are standing in the middle of it. \"Wynne want images of other people? Or just alone?\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:34:27.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745546208809975819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“Alone is fine. I think seeing anyone would make me sad.” Wynne takes a seat. “I’m sorry for earlier, Web.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:36:13.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745546653184032830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web nods calmly. Their are no sounds of people in the village, but it manages to not feel lonely.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:37:07.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745546878862491719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web crouches down and a chair appears underneath them. One appears in front of Wynne, on the other side of a small table. There are glasses of fresh water. \"Anything to drink?\" Web asks, grinning.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:38:15.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547164867887145","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Wynne sits down and takes a cup. “Thanks. This is comfier than where I’m sleeping.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:39:15.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547415192338452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web nods. \"I'm glad.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:39:32.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547488286736495","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Figured Web couldn't be as scared of getting hurt if not really here.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:40:00.704000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547605282652210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Wynne winces.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:40:14.589000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547663520432159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web nods sadly. \"Not Wynne fault. Wynne not do anything wrong. Web just have bad memories. And some things make me think of them again.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:41:10.191000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547896732254230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Saw the body. Glad you thought of me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:41:25.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745547960850579556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They take a small sip of their water.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:41:41.903000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745548029742022737","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Fyr give Gold to Wynne?\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:42:15.458000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745548170481893377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Wynne shakes their head. “I told him to leave the gold for you. I didn’t want to accept money you were giving because you were afraid.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:44:29.619000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745548733193912413","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web chuckles sadly. \"Wasn't there when got home. Should make sure Fyr don't have it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:45:03.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745548877276512286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"And don't want to give Wynne gold because Web afraid. Want to give Wynne gold because Wynne a friend. Wynne earned it. Baesides, if Wynne take it, that makes Web feel like apology accepted.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:46:07.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745549142591406171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They pause for a moment. \"Really am sorry.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:46:19.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745549193854189600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“For what? You didn’t do anything wrong.” They look sad.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:47:04.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745549381712871518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Web make mistakes. Web make talk with fishmother harder. Web be afraid of Wynne though Web promise not to. Web make Wynne sad.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:48:15.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745549679420375161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They set their water down. “Doesn’t matter. It worked out in the end, so no harm no foul. Even if it had ended poorly, I wouldn’t have blamed you. And I’m upset with *me*, because something I did made you feel unsafe.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:52:00.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745550625848426547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web shrugs. \"Web feel unsafe so much. Rare day when Web feel safe all the time, or even most.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:53:31.348000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745551005370023948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They nod slowly.","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:54:34.071000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745551268449353749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web sighs. \"Wish was different. Maybe can be. But so hard not to be on edge, not to be scared.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:55:07.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745551410598379590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They nod again. “Used to happen with my mom a lot. Sometimes something flashes her back, to a time when she was more afraid. Makes her scared.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:56:23.145000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745551725938737222","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Web nods. They look to Wynne. \"Still so much of me worried that any mistake means I get hurt. Like still a kid trying to make friends and failing.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:57:36.004000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-19T07:57:39.217000Z","id":"745552031531663372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Have responsibilities now. Have family. More to protect. More to lose.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:58:01.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745552138096082975","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They stare off into the distance. \"Still feel I could have saved Sandigill. Town wouldn't have been divided if had been more careful about raising dead.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:59:11.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745552433056317461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"They sigh. \"But that not fair. Web know that.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T07:59:56.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745552619535335436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"“How do you think I feel? I was locked in a cage for almost a week, and the town was almost destroyed.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T08:01:26.599000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745552998717063230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
